          "1. Nominates the Candidate: Has the exclusive prerogative to select and nominate a suitable royal candidate to occupy a vacant stool/skin.",
          "2. Principal Advisor: Acts as the senior counselor to the chief, possessing the unique customary right to reprimand him in private when he violates traditions.",
          "3. Women & Child Welfare: Champions girls' education, maternal healthcare, and arbitrates domestic disputes involving women.",
          "Traditional Hierarchy: Paramount Chief (Omanhene) -> Divisional Chief -> Sub-chief -> Odikro (Village Chief)."
