          "Royal Blood Lineage: The candidate must be a verifiable member of the royal family. Traced through matrilineal lineage among Akans (mother's side), and patrilineal lineage among Ga, Ewe, and Northern ethnic groups (father's side).",
          "Physical Wholeness: The candidate must be physically whole, without any missing limbs, visible physical deformity, or severe disfigurement (traditionally viewed as an omen).",
          "Moral Integrity and Character: Must have an unblemished reputation: no history of criminal theft, fraud, drunkenness, violent temper, or adultery.",
